      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re adjusting the offset to be relative to the last 256k of flash. I don\u0027t think this is the right approach.\n\n- If you\u0027re flashing the entire image (no -i param to flashrom) then your image needs to match the size of the SPI\n- If you\u0027re flashing only specific regions (-i param to flashrom) then your fmap needs to point to the right regions (not the regions offset CONFIG_FLASH_BASE_SPI)",
